# Project Guidelines

- This is a React Native application, do not use expo.
- Use TypeScript.
- Use functional components and hooks.
- Make the app modular.
- Reuse existing utilities and components before creating new ones.
- Create a unit test for each created feature.
- Run type checking after significant changes.
- Do not modify native iOS/Android configuration unless necessary.
- Always check if the created feature works in both iOS and Android.